@intent The mod's Curios accessories, put on by a survival player in the Curios screen, give what their code promises -- the ring and necklace their justified-defence bonuses, the crown its extra health, the wings survival flight -- and taking each off takes it away again (TLS-057). For Curios 10-14 (1.21.4..1.21.11), whose /curios replace refuses every slot: 13-curios-accessories does the same through that command elsewhere.
@continue-on-fail
# The Curios screen's menu: 0-45 the vanilla inventory (hotbar 36-44), then the curio slots; the first curio slot (46)
# takes any of these accessories, so each is put on there, swapping out the one before (back into its hotbar slot).
@step arena
# a command that changes nothing fails: go through creative so survival is a change
gamemode creative
gamemode survival
time set day
execute if entity @e[type=!minecraft:player] run kill @e[type=!minecraft:player]
scoreboard objectives add pt_def dummy
scoreboard objectives add pt_rec dummy
scoreboard objectives add pt_now dummy
scoreboard objectives add pt_hp health
execute store result score @s pt_def run attribute @s the_last_sword:max_justified_defence get 100
execute store result score @s pt_rec run attribute @s the_last_sword:justified_defence_recovery_speed get 10000
item replace entity @s hotbar.0 with the_last_sword:dragon_crystal_ring
item replace entity @s hotbar.1 with the_last_sword:dragon_crystal_necklace
item replace entity @s hotbar.2 with the_last_sword:dragon_crystal_crown
item replace entity @s hotbar.3 with the_last_sword:wings_that_cover_the_world

@step ring: the dragon crystal ring adds max justified defence while worn
@key key.curios.open.desc
@wait 1s
@expect screen curios within 3s
@click slot 36
@click slot 46
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 1s
@assert execute unless items entity @s hotbar.0 the_last_sword:dragon_crystal_ring
execute store result score @s pt_now run attribute @s the_last_sword:max_justified_defence get 100
@assert execute if score @s pt_now > @s pt_def

@step necklace: the necklace raises justified defence recovery speed, and the ring's bonus goes with the ring
@key key.curios.open.desc
@wait 1s
@click slot 37
@click slot 46
@click slot 37
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 1s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.1 the_last_sword:dragon_crystal_ring
execute store result score @s pt_now run attribute @s the_last_sword:justified_defence_recovery_speed get 10000
@assert execute if score @s pt_now > @s pt_rec
execute store result score @s pt_now run attribute @s the_last_sword:max_justified_defence get 100
@assert execute if score @s pt_now = @s pt_def

@step crown: the dragon crystal crown's +200 max health lets the player heal above 20
@key key.curios.open.desc
@wait 1s
@click slot 38
@click slot 46
@click slot 38
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 1s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.2 the_last_sword:dragon_crystal_necklace
effect give @s minecraft:instant_health 1 20 true
@wait 1s
@assert execute if score @s pt_hp matches 40..
@shot crowned

@step wings: Wings That Cover the World let a survival player fly while worn, and the crown's health goes with it
@key key.curios.open.desc
@wait 1s
@click slot 39
@click slot 46
@click slot 39
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 2s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.3 the_last_sword:dragon_crystal_crown
@assert execute if entity @s[nbt={abilities:{mayfly:1b}}]
@assert execute if score @s pt_hp matches ..20

@step off: taking the wings off takes flight away
@key key.curios.open.desc
@wait 1s
@click slot 46
@click slot 44
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 2s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.8 the_last_sword:wings_that_cover_the_world
@assert execute if entity @s[nbt={abilities:{mayfly:0b}}]
